  "request": "Support guarded plan rewind from the implementation stage. Add an official guarded, reasoned, and audited flow-level plan rewind from impl-review, impl-gate, retro, acceptance, and final-regression. Atomically invalidate coherent state, retry, and evidence while preserving source and task routing; require renewed plan approval and verification; reject at the finalize boundary. Stop on isolation failure, target mismatch, data-loss, orphan, baseline, authentication, or billing conditions. Exclude other flows, push, publish, and release.",
